      "result": "{\"cursor\":13987,\"log\":\"cb\\u0027\\u003eMultiversal Passage\\u003c/font\\u003e [1bf]\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eDSV3 Analyst\\u003c/font\\u003e loses 1 life at combat from \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#B0C4DE\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00271bfe6883-2e6a-4cac-988c-8ac39868facb\\u0027\\u003eMultiversal Passage\\u003c/font\\u003e [1bf]\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eDSV3 Analyst\\u003c/font\\u003e loses 2 life at combat from \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#90EE90\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00273256702b-93a3-4417-a5b4-1f21c10d42f2\\u0027\\u003eFormidable Speaker\\u003c/font\\u003e [325]\\nTURN 4 for \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eDSV3 Analyst\\u003c/font\\u003e (20 - 9)\\n\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\u0027#20B2AA\\u0027\\u003eDSV3 Analyst\\u003c/font\\u003e draws a card\",\"truncated\":true,\"total_length\":13987}",
